OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FLinton Stephens introduces
OL,12,     Fhighlights from the Proms,
OL,13,     Fincluding music by Strauss and
OL,14,     Fchamber performances from this
OL,15,     Fyear's Montpellier Festival and
OL,16,     FRocamadour Festival in France.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Elisabeth
OL,18,G     Jacquet de La Guerre
OL,19,     F2/5. Jacquet joins the court in
OL,20,     FVersailles and the circle of the
OL,21,     Fmost powerful woman in France.
